build/

## Scratch files a work session leaves in the working copy. The local file-safety policy on
## this machine refuses deletions, so they are ignored rather than removed. They are not
## part of the product and should be deleted by hand.
.tmp-*
tools/add-backup-destination-string.ps1

## The stray solution file the first `dotnet new sln` left behind. StoreFlow.sln is the
## authoritative one; the .slnx only makes a bare `dotnet build` in the root ambiguous.
*.slnx
